Title: Harry Potter: HBO series begins production as first image released
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Production has begun on the new TV adaptation of Harry Potter, as the first picture of the lead actor in costume was released.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 95}}, {'Description': 'Producers released the first picture of 11-year-old Dominic McLaughlin in costume as Harry Potter on Monday and confirmed several new cast members.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 119}}, {'Description': 'Rory Wilmot hast been cast as Neville Longbottom, Amos Kitson as Dudley Dursley, Louise Brealey as Madam Rolanda Hooch, and Anton Lesser as Garrick Ollivander.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 133}}, {'Description': 'They join stars such as John Lithgow, who will play Dumbledore, Nick Frost as Hagrid, Janet McTeer as Minerva McGonagall and Paapa Essiedu as Severus Snape.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 137}}, {'Description': 'Producers also announced new production staff, several of whom have previously worked on The Crown such as director of photography Adriano Goldman and hair and makeup designer Cate Hall.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 10, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 158}}, {'Description': 'The first series will launch in 2027.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 11, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 34}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Dominic McLaughlin as Harry Potter'}]}
